{"id":878596,"title":"12｜案例解析-Agent类（股票分析）","content":"通过给智能体添加专业工具，如股票查询工具，可以显著提升其分析能力。以证券分析师角色为例，该智能体能够根据用户提供的股票名称查询数据并进行深入分析。当用户询问贵州茅台时，智能体自动调用工具查询最新股价和财务数据，提供包括近期趋势、财务表现和技术分析在内的全面报告。这种结合外部插件的方法确保了信息的时效性和准确性，克服了仅依赖预训练数据导致的信息滞后问题。因此，智能体与专业工具的结合不仅提高了数据分析的精度，也为用户提供更可靠的投资建议。","comments":[{"had_liked":false,"id":400653,"user_name":"木晴冰雪","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1114827,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"C8B01B46D7EC2F","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/11/02/cb/c4740ec7.jpg","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748796262,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":1,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"请问涉及到的提示词和相关的资料能提供下嘛","like_count":1,"discussions":[{"author":{"id":1014589,"avatar":"https://static001.geekbang.org/account/avatar/00/0f/7b/3d/b1ec162d.jpg","nickname":"彭延福","note":"","ucode":"9E3357E8F09FB2","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"reply_author":{"id":0,"avatar":"","nickname":"","note":"","ucode":"","race_medal":0,"user_type":1,"is_pvip":false},"discussion":{"id":662782,"discussion_content":"我也需要提示词学习学习","content_length":11,"likes_number":0,"is_delete":false,"is_hidden":false,"ctime":1749196274,"is_liked":false,"can_delete":false,"is_complain":false,"is_top":false,"parent_id":0,"ip_address":"广东","group_id":0,"attachments":[]},"score":2,"extra":"","child_discussion_number":0,"child_discussions":[]}]},{"had_liked":false,"id":400566,"user_name":"Geek2751","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":3790296,"ip_address":"上海","ucode":"1B844E0334CAD0","user_header":"","comment_is_top":false,"comment_ctime":1748346653,"is_pvip":false,"replies":null,"discussion_count":0,"race_medal":0,"score":2,"product_id":101048201,"comment_content":"老师，股票分析的prompt的提示词，分享一下可以吗？","like_count":0},{"had_liked":false,"id":400469,"user_name":"西","can_delete":false,"product_type":"c3","uid":1202447,"ip_address":"广东","ucode":"439CF4B1FEF9EE","user_header":"https://static001.geekbang.org/accoun